@startuml
title Emergency response reconfiguration with snapshot traversal

|Incident Commander|
start
:Receive power-plant fire report;
:Request current incident view;

|TaskForge|
:Create depth-first snapshot;
:Create reverse snapshot;

fork
  :Read next depth-first task;
  while (More tasks?) is (yes)
    :Display task description;
    :Read next depth-first task;
  endwhile (no)
fork again
  :Dispatch nested incident group;
  :Run task sendOut()
  <<callBehavior>>;
end fork

|Incident Commander|
:Chemical hazard escalates;
:Request hazmat support;

|TaskForge|
:Create dispatchAmbulance;
:Wrap with PriorityDispatchDecorator;
:Stack AuditDispatchDecorator;
:Add decorated hazmat task to incident;

if (Use existing snapshot?) then (yes)
  :Keep original membership;
  :Do not show hazmat task;
else (fresh snapshot)
  :Capture updated incident membership;
  :Show hazmat task;
endif

:Dispatch updated incident;
:Record audit entries;

|Incident Commander|
:Review dispatch evidence;
stop
@enduml
